```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant C as Conversation Svc
  participant M as Masking
  participant L as LLM API
  participant S as SOP Svc
  U->>G: POST /conversation/parse
  G->>C: route(payload)
  C->>M: redact PII
  M->>L: prompt(actions draft)
  L-->>C: actions[], cautions[], errors[]
  C-->>S: createDraft(actions)
  S-->>U: SOP draft (cards)
```